The ViperX geometry and calibrated MuJoCo arm model are derived from the
MuJoCo Menagerie ALOHA model, licensed under BSD-3-Clause. The bundled copy of
that license is in LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt.

The mobile base is a simplified Tracer-compatible differential-drive model intended
for controller integration tests; it is not a calibrated dynamics model.
